<p>This image has been assessed under the <i><a href="/wiki/Commons:Valued_image_criteria" title="Commons:Valued image criteria">valued image criteria</a></i> and is considered <b>the most valued image on Commons</b> within the scope: <b><a href="/wiki/Category:Interior_of_Teatro_Olimpico_(Vicenza)" title="Category:Interior of Teatro Olimpico (Vicenza)">Interior of Teatro Olimpico (Vicenza)</a> - stage wall (Scaenae frons), stage, and orchestra pit</b>. You can see its nomination <a href="/wiki/Commons:Valued_image_candidates/Interior_of_Teatro_Olimpico_(Vicenza)_scena_.jpg" title="Commons:Valued image candidates/Interior of Teatro Olimpico (Vicenza) scena .jpg">here</a>.
