<div class="hproduct commons-file-information-table">
<table class="fileinfotpl-type-information vevent" dir="ltr">

<tbody><tr>
<td id="fileinfotpl&#95;desc" class="fileinfo-paramfield" lang="en">Description<span class="summary fn" style="display:none">Interior of Teatro Olimpico (Vicenza) scena .jpg</span></td>
<td class="description">
<div class="multilingual"><div class="description en lang-en" lang="en" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-en" lang="en" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>English</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teatro_Olimpico" class="extiw" title="w:Teatro Olimpico">Teatro Olimpico</a>. Theater located in Vicenza, designed in 1580 by the architect of the Renaissance <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrea_Palladio" class="extiw" title="w:Andrea Palladio">Andrea Palladio</a>. It is generally considered the first permanent covered theater of modern times. View of the stage wall (Scaenae frons), the stage, and the orchestra pit.</div><div class="description fr lang-fr" lang="fr" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-fr" lang="fr" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Français</bdi>&#x202f;&#x3a;&#32;</span> <a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teatro_Olimpico" class="extiw" title="fr:Teatro Olimpico">Teatro Olimpico</a>. Théâtre situé à Vicence, dessiné en 1580 par l'architecte de la Renaissance <a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrea_Palladio" class="extiw" title="fr:Andrea Palladio">Andrea Palladio</a>. Il est généralement considéré comme le premier théâtre couvert permanent de l'époque moderne. Vue du  mur de scène, (Scaenae frons), de la scène, et de la fosse d'orchestre.</div><div class="description it lang-it" lang="it" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-it" lang="it" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Italiano</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> <a href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teatro_Olimpico" class="extiw" title="it:Teatro Olimpico">Teatro Olimpico</a>. Teatro situato a Vicenza, progettato nel 1580 dall'architetto del Rinascimento <a href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andrea_Palladio" class="extiw" title="it:Andrea Palladio">Andrea Palladio</a>. È generalmente considerato il primo teatro permanente coperto dei tempi moderni. Vista sul muro di palcoscenico (Scaenae frons), sul palco e sull'orchestra.</div></div>
<div class="vcard">
<table class="toccolours collapsible collapsed" cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" dir="ltr" style="text-align:left; border-collapse:collapse; background: var(--background-color-interactive-subtle, #f0f0ff); color: inherit; border:1px solid #aaa;" lang="en">
